       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BTICMP5.
      * BALANCE TRANSFER INTEREST - STEP 2 ACCRUAL
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY BTIFLG5.
       01  WS-OUTSTANDING            PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-UNPAID-CHARGES         PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-INT-BASE               PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-RATE                   PIC 9(2)V99 VALUE 42.00.
       01  WS-INTEREST               PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-BT-INT-RUN
           ACCEPT WS-OUTSTANDING
           ACCEPT WS-UNPAID-CHARGES
           IF BT-INT-ON
              PERFORM 2000-ACCRUE
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'INTEREST: ' WS-INTEREST
           STOP RUN.
       2000-ACCRUE.
           COMPUTE WS-INT-BASE = WS-OUTSTANDING - WS-UNPAID-CHARGES
           IF WS-INT-BASE > ZERO
              COMPUTE WS-INTEREST ROUNDED =
                      (WS-INT-BASE * WS-RATE) / 1200
           END-IF.
